  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5604.02 Account Set-Up",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5604.02 Account Set-Up.\n\n(a) A person shall contact the Department of Safety, Division of Administration, Business Office at 33 Hazen Drive, Concord, NH 03305 or accountsreceivable@dos.nh.gov to set up an account.\n\n(b) A person establishing an account shall provide their name, mailing and legal address, date of birth, company name, and phone number.\n\n(c) The department shall issue a unique four number personal identification number (PIN) for use by the account holder or a person authorized pursuant to 5604.03, when requesting information via fax or telephone. An account holder may cancel his/her PIN and obtain a new number by contacting the business office as specified in (a), above.\n\n(d) A minimum of $100.00 deposit shall be made to establish the account.\n\n(e) The department shall notify the account holder when the balance is less than $25.00.\n\nSource. #6403, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-97; rpld and ss by #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02; ss by #13152, EXEMPT, eff 12-31-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
